    "nativeFacings": "Right figures in top row, left figures in bottom row. Each is an authored drawing; renderer uses no mirroring.",
    "anatomy": "Whole bodies, two fists, knees and feet inspected. Blades retracted during shuffle; same masked costume preserved. Fine finger and canon1:1 fidelity not certified.",
    "movement": "Substantial stance-width change with consistent front foot leading; acceptable short approach shuffle, not a full locomotion library.",
    "pivots": "Each support y is lowest alpha>2 pixel plus one; x is midpoint of the illustrated feet in the bottom50px alpha>16 support band. One body-height reference per native page, never per-frame fitting.",
